     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Sorry for the delay in replying. For now here&#39;s a replacement S4 method, just include this in your server.R:<div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:18px\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">setMethod<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;toJSON&quot;</span><span>,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;numeric&quot;</span><span>,</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding-left:10px\"><font color=\"#333333\">           </font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">(</span><font color=\"#333333\">x</font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">,</span><font color=\"#333333\"> container </font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">=</span><font color=\"#333333\">  isContainer</font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">(</span><font color=\"#333333\">x</font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">,</span><font color=\"#333333\"> asIs</font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">,</span><font color=\"#333333\"> .level</font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">),</span><font color=\"#333333\"> collapse </font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">=</span><font color=\"#333333\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">,</span><font color=\"#333333\"> digits </font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">=</span><font color=\"#333333\"> </font><font color=\"#009999\">10</font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">,</span><font color=\"#333333\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">...</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51)\">,</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">                      .level <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">1L</span><span>,</span> .withNames <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> length<span>(</span>x<span>)</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&gt;</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">0</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&amp;&amp;</span> length<span>(</span>names<span>(</span>x<span>))</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&gt;</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,153,153)\">0</span><span>,</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">                        .na <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;null&quot;</span><span>,</span> .escapeEscapes <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">TRUE</span><span>,</span> pretty <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">FALSE</span><span>,</span> asIs <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">NA</span><span>)</span> <span>{</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">            <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">if</span><span>(</span>any<span>(</span>is.infinite<span>(</span>x<span>)))</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">              warning<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;non-fininte values in numeric vector may not be approriately represented in JSON&quot;</span><span>)</span>             </div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">             tmp <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> formatC<span>(</span>x<span>,</span> digits <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> digits<span>)</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">             <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">if</span><span>(</span>any<span>(</span>nas <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407952812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_EJz6NkWkmxfJs6YWbDzr\">is.na</a><span>(</span>x<span>)))</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">                 tmp<span>[</span>nas<span>]</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> .na                          </div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">             </div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">             <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">if</span><span>(</span>container<span>)</span> <span>{</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">                <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">if</span><span>(</span>.withNames<span>)</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">\r\n\r\n                   paste<span>(</span>sprintf<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;{%s&quot;</span><span>,</span> collapse<span>),</span> paste<span>(</span>dQuote<span>(</span>names<span>(</span>x<span>)),</span> tmp<span>,</span> sep <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;: &quot;</span><span>,</span> collapse <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> sprintf<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;,%s&quot;</span><span>,</span> collapse<span>)),</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">                                   sprintf<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;%s}&quot;</span><span>,</span> collapse<span>))</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">                <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">else</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">                   paste<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;[&quot;</span><span>,</span> paste<span>(</span>tmp<span>,</span> collapse <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;, &quot;</span><span>),</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;]&quot;</span><span>)</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">             <span>}</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">else</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">\r\n\r\n               tmp</div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);padding-left:10px\">           <span>})</span><div><br></div></div></pre></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n\r\nOn Fri, Jul 12, 2013 at 7:44 PM, Kirill Savin <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kirill...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\nHi,<br><br>I am trying to pass a matrix through <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">sendCustomMessage()</span> to update highstock/highchart plot with new values. <br><br>The matrix contains a pair of variables: Javascript UTC time (milliseconds since 1970) and number to plot on y-axis like in <a href=\"http://www.highcharts.com/samples/data/three-series-1000-points.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.highcharts.com/samples/data/three-series-1000-points.js&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407952813000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02lq1YVaI0rpwe-JQxtTFw\">this sample</a>. <br>\r\n\r\n<br>UTC time is too large and coerces to scientific notation(e.g. 1.373e+12) by <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">toJSON()</span> function used inside <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">sendCustomMessage()<font face=\"arial,sans-serif\"> and passes to javascript with reduced precision, messing up my plots. <br>\r\n\r\n<br>Is it possible to somehow override </font></span><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><br></span><pre>     .sendCustomMessage = function(type, message) {\r\n      data &lt;- list()\r\n      data[[type]] &lt;- message\r\n      .write(toJSON(list(custom=data)))<br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">with </span><br><br>     .sendCustomMessage = function(type, message, ...) {\r\n      data &lt;- list()\r\n      data[[type]] &lt;- message\r\n      .write(toJSON(list(custom=data)), ...)<br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">so it is possible to pass <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">digits </span>and other parameters to</span> toJSON()?<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n\r\n</font></span></pre><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407952813000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0tHN2HrYOUAvz9uweT7YMI\">https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out</a>.<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
