tation(e.g. 1.373e+12) by <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">toJSON()</span> function used inside <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">sendCustomMessage()<font face=\"arial,sans-serif\"> and passes to javascript with reduced precision, messing up my plots. <br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>Is it possible to somehow override </font></span><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><br></span><pre>     .sendCustomMessage = function(type, message) {\r\n      data &lt;- list()\r\n      data[[type]] &lt;- message\r\n      .write(toJSON(list(custom=data)))<br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">with </span><br><br>     .sendCustomMessage = function(type, message, ...) {\r\n      data &lt;- list()\r\n      data[[type]] &lt;- message\r\n      .write(toJSON(list(custom=data)), ...)<br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">so it is possible to pass <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">digits </span>and other parameters to</span> toJSON()?<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</font></span></pre><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407952816000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0AXketsmr1sxS87NhYbP33\">https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out</a>.<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n"
